Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 09:00:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD selected-agent slash execution so backend commands
 bypass prompt sends

Route selected-agent slash tokens through a provider command path instead of ordinary chat sends, with Codex using app-server command actions and other providers returning a neutral unsupported-command reply.
